  "decisions": [
    {
      "text": "Amounts are integer piconero (long / bigint), never floating point",
      "date": "2026-11-17",
      "by": "claude"
    },
    {
      "text": "Same origin everywhere: /api prefix, Vite proxy in dev, API serves the client in production, no CORS",
      "date": "2026-11-18",
      "by": "claude"
    },
    {
      "text": "ESLint as the client linter",
      "date": "2026-11-18",
      "by": "claude"
    },
    {
      "text": "users table: identity id, normalized unique email, PHC password hash, role, is_frozen",
      "feature": "E1",
      "date": "2026-11-18",
      "by": "claude"
    },
    {
      "text": "Argon2id m=19456 KiB, t=2, p=1 in PHC format, rehash on login when outdated",
      "feature": "E1",
      "date": "2026-11-18",
      "by": "claude"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hand-written C# migration runner, one transaction per file, schema_migrations table",
      "date": "2026-11-18",
      "by": "claude"
    },
    {
      "text": "Migration runner serialized with a session-level advisory lock, released explicitly in finally (pooling: close does not unlock)",
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "by": "claude"
    },
    {
      "text": "Login hides whether an email exists (same error, dummy hash); registration enumeration is an accepted risk, mitigated by B2",
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "by": "claude",
      "feature": "E1"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tests run the migration runner once per test run, via a shared xUnit fixture on a freshly reset obscura_test",
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "by": "claude"
    },
    {
      "text": "Passwords normalized to NFKC before hashing (no trim, no case folding); max 128 characters, checked before hashing",
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "by": "claude",
      "feature": "E1"
    },
    {
      "text": "Passwords 15–128 Unicode code points after NFKC; no composition rules, spaces allowed",
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "by": "claude",
      "feature": "E1"
    },
    {
      "text": "DB tests share one collection fixture (IAsyncLifetime): obscura_test reset and migrated once per run",
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "by": "claude"
    },
    {
      "text": "Password blocklist moves to B2",
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "by": "claude",
      "feature": "E1"
    },
    {
      "text": "DB tests truncate data tables (RESTART IDENTITY CASCADE) at the start of each test; real commits are needed for E4 concurrency tests",
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "by": "claude"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hand-written per-request validators, errors as ProblemDetails; register 201/400/409, login collapses every failure into one generic 401",
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "by": "claude",
      "feature": "E1"
    },
    {
      "text": "Email: structural check, max 254 (validation + CHECK in 0002); React register/login pages move to E2",
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "by": "claude",
      "feature": "E1"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hand-written AuthenticationHandler with server-side sessions in PostgreSQL; cookie holds a 256-bit token, DB stores only SHA-256(token)",
      "date": "2026-11-21",
      "by": "claude",
      "feature": "E2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cookie __Host-session (Secure, HttpOnly, SameSite=Strict, Path=/), always Secure incl. dev and tests; idle 15 min / absolute 8 h; login rotates, logout deletes the row",
      "date": "2026-11-21",
      "by": "claude",
      "feature": "E2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Order: E2 before E3 (E3 identifies the account owner from the session)",
      "date": "2026-11-21",
      "by": "claude"
    },
    {
      "text": "__Host-session (Secure, HttpOnly, SameSite=Strict) accepted and sent back on http://localhost via the Vite proxy in Brave (Chromium) and Firefox",
      "date": "2026-11-21",
      "by": "claude",
      "feature": "E2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Not needed for E2: Secure cookies work on http://localhost (browsers treat it as a secure context); tests use https://localhost. Revisit for HSTS in E7.",
      "date": "2026-11-21",
      "by": "claude",
      "feature": "E2"
    }
  ],
